      <div class="rf-guide-answer">
        <strong>THE SHORT The most useful roofing lead generation strategy connects relevant advertising with project-specific qualification, reliable follow-up and booked estimates. For established contractors, the key measure is not simply how many forms arrive but how many suitable roofing opportunities progress through the sales pipeline.</strong>
        <p>The most useful roofing lead generation strategy connects relevant advertising with project-specific qualification, reliable follow-up and booked estimates. For established contractors, the key measure is not simply how many forms arrive but how many suitable roofing opportunities progress through the sales pipeline.</p>
      </div>
