<section class="lf-article-section">
  <h2>What is the best way to get roofing leads?</h2>

  <p>
    The best way to generate roofing leads depends on
    your services, local demand and sales capacity.
    Start by defining your preferred roofing projects
    and service area. Then connect relevant marketing
    channels to a qualification and follow-up process.
  </p>

  <p>
    Google Search can reach property owners actively
    seeking roofing work. Facebook and Instagram can
    create interest earlier in the buying journey.
    Local SEO, customer referrals and reviews also
    help people discover roofing contractors.
  </p>

  <h3>How do roofing contractors find leads?</h3>

  <p>
    Common sources include referrals, local search,
    Google Ads, Facebook advertising, roofing lead
    generation websites and third-party lead providers.
    Measure qualified inquiries and sold jobs rather
    than only counting submitted forms.
  </p>

  <h3>Are exclusive roofing leads better than shared leads?</h3>

  <p>
    Shared inquiries may go to several contractors.
    Exclusive roofing leads are generally intended
    for one buyer, depending on the provider's terms.
    Exclusivity does not guarantee lead quality.
    Check how inquiries are collected, verified,
    delivered and priced.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="lf-article-section">
        <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>
        <h3>Are exclusive roofing leads better than shared leads?</h3>
        <p>Exclusive lead arrangements may reduce direct competition
          for the same inquiry, but exclusivity alone does not guarantee
          a qualified project. Ask how leads are sourced, qualified,
          delivered and measured.</p>
        <h3>Should roofers use Google Ads or Facebook Ads?</h3>
        <p>Google Search can capture existing demand, while social ads
          can introduce the business earlier in the buying journey.
          The best choice depends on the service, geography,
          available creative, budget and sales follow-up.</p>
        <h3>How long does roofing lead generation take?</h3>
        <p>Timelines vary with the market, campaign setup, landing-page
          quality and sales process. Early testing can reveal technical
          and qualification problems, but reliable performance requires
          sufficient relevant data.</p>
